	<div id="primary" class="content-area primary">

		
					<main id="main" class="site-main">
				<article class="post-307 page type-page status-publish ast-article-single" id="post-307" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork" itemscope="itemscope">
	
	
	<header class="entry-header ast-no-thumbnail ast-no-title ast-header-without-markup">
			</header> <!-- .entry-header -->


<div class="entry-content clear" ast-blocks-layout="true" itemprop="text">

	
	
<div class="wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-0a3c038c alignfull uagb-is-root-container"><div class="uagb-container-inner-blocks-wrap">
<div class="wp-block-uagb-advanced-heading uagb-block-68c7b934"><p class="uagb-desc-text">PH Garment is a professional women’s garment supplier in OEM and ODM.</p><h1 class="uagb-heading-text"><strong>Your Trusted Women’s Garment Supplier</strong></h1></div>



<div class="wp-block-uagb-container uagb-layout-grid uagb-block-a3676eea">
<div class="wp-block-uagb-image uagb-block-edde58d1 wp-block-uagb-image--layout-default wp-block-uagb-image--effect-static wp-block-uagb-image--align-none"><figure class="wp-block-uagb-image__figure"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" srcset="https://gmtph.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/pexels-photo-7147468.jpeg ,https://gmtph.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/pexels-photo-7147468.jpeg 780w, https://gmtph.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/pexels-photo-7147468.jpeg 360w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 480px) 150px" src="./Image 2_files/pexels-photo-7147468.jpeg" alt="" class="uag-image-6050" width="384" height="400" title="about-img-01" role="img"></figure></div>



<div class="wp-block-uagb-image uagb-block-18e746cf wp-block-uagb-image--layout-default wp-block-uagb-image--effect-static wp-block-uagb-image--align-none"><figure class="wp-block-uagb-image__figure"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" srcset="https://gmtph.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/pexels-photo-7147661.jpeg ,https://gmtph.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/pexels-photo-7147661.jpeg 780w, https://gmtph.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/pexels-photo-7147661.jpeg 360w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 480px) 150px" src="./Image 2_files/pexels-photo-7147661.jpeg" alt="" class="uag-image-6051" width="792" height="400" title="about-img-02" role="img"></figure></div>
</div>
</div></div>



<div class="wp-block-uagb-container uagb-layout-grid uagb-block-08603c8b alignfull uagb-is-root-container"><div class="uagb-container-inner-blocks-wrap">
<div class="wp-block-uagb-advanced-heading uagb-block-760f95e3"><h2 class="uagb-heading-text">PH Garment&nbsp;is your premier choice women’s clothing manufacturer</h2></div>



<div class="wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-5dc1fafb uagb-infobox__content-wrap  uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top"><div class="uagb-ifb-content"><div class="uagb-ifb-title-wrap"><h3 class="uagb-ifb-title-prefix">If you’re a brand or retailer that values exceptional value for money, then look no further! PH Garment&nbsp;is your premier choice women’s clothing supplier, ready to cater to your orders with utmost dedication.</h3><p class="uagb-ifb-title">For this part, we will write an additional introduction of you or your business. This can be about your company history, success stories, or the product or services you offer. It can also tell about how you helped clients achieve their desired results.</p></div><p class="uagb-ifb-desc">For this part, we will Our Commitment to Excellence:<br>At PH Garment, we go beyond mere cutting and sewing; we embody quality, service, innovation, and flexibility in clothing manufacturing.<br><br><strong>Who:</strong><br>PH Garment is a professional garment supplier that specializes in Original Equipment Manufacturing (OEM) and Original Design Manufacturing (ODM). The company provides services to fashion brands, retailers, and businesses seeking high-quality, custom-made apparel.<br><strong>What:</strong><br>PH Garment offers a wide selection of materials and advanced production techniques to meet the specific requirements of their clients. Their expertise includes sourcing premium fabrics, creating custom designs, and handling production for a variety of clothing types. They cater to both large and small orders, ensuring flexibility and precision in every project.<br><strong>Where:</strong><br>Based in a leading textile manufacturing region, PH Garment operates from a strategically located facility that enables them to access high-quality resources and skilled labor. This location allows the company to offer competitive pricing while maintaining strict quality control throughout the production process.<br><strong>Why:</strong><br>PH Garment is dedicated to helping clients bring their clothing designs to life. By offering both OEM and ODM services, they provide businesses with the ability to either manufacture their existing designs or collaborate on new, custom designs. Their commitment to quality, innovation, and customer satisfaction sets them apart as a trusted partner in the garment industry.<br><strong>When:</strong><br>PH Garment has been serving the garment industry for several years, gaining extensive experience in apparel manufacturing. Their production schedules are designed to meet client deadlines while ensuring that each project is completed to the highest standards of quality and craftsmanship. Whether you’re launching a new clothing line or expanding your brand, PH Garment is ready to assist at any time.</p></div></div>
</div></div>



<div class="wp-block-uagb-container uagb-layout-grid uagb-block-60548ee6 alignfull uagb-is-root-container"><div class="uagb-container-inner-blocks-wrap">
<div class="wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-43b8b897"></div>



<div class="wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-e70ef1c3">
<div class="wp-block-uagb-advanced-heading uagb-block-763f0174"><h3 class="uagb-heading-text">wide range of garments</h3><p class="uagb-desc-text">At PH Garment, we specialize in producing a wide range of garments, including <strong>shorts, skirts, blouses, and dresses</strong>&nbsp;in any style or size you require. Our <strong>cut &amp; sew garments</strong>&nbsp;are crafted with precision, delivering a clean, sophisticated, and polished appearance that aligns with your brand’s vision.</p></div>



<p></p>
</div>



<div class="wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-be866ff8"></div>



<div class="wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-5ee10564">
<div class="wp-block-uagb-advanced-heading uagb-block-5f74cbed"><h4 class="uagb-heading-text"><strong>Fabrics</strong></h4><p class="uagb-desc-text">We offer a broad selection of <strong>customizable fabrics</strong>&nbsp;to match your specific needs. Whether you’re looking for classic materials or something more unique, we have many fabric suggestions to choose from. In addition, we provide hundreds of <strong>print designs and patterns</strong>, allowing for endless possibilities in customization.</p></div>
</div>



<div class="wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-773529b0">
<div class="wp-block-uagb-advanced-heading uagb-block-289d8267"><h4 class="uagb-heading-text"><strong>Sampling</strong></h4><p class="uagb-desc-text">Our experienced technical team is here to help you achieve the perfect <strong>fit and look</strong>&nbsp;for any garment. We work closely with you during the sampling process to ensure every detail meets your expectations. <strong>Samples</strong>&nbsp;typically take about <strong>1–2 weeks</strong>&nbsp;to produce.</p></div>
</div>



<div class="wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-4713ec62">
<div class="wp-block-uagb-advanced-heading uagb-block-b07ef287"><h4 class="uagb-heading-text"><strong>Minimum Order Quantities (MOQs)</strong></h4><p class="uagb-desc-text">The <strong>minimum order quantity (MOQ)</strong>&nbsp;is set at <strong>800 pieces per color</strong>, providing an ideal balance for efficient production while ensuring the high-quality standards your brand demands.</p></div>
</div>
</div></div>



<div class="wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-e460d63f alignfull uagb-is-root-container"><div class="uagb-container-inner-blocks-wrap">
<div class="wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-2d9e82ad uagb-infobox__content-wrap  uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top wp-block-uagb-info-box--has-margin"><div class="uagb-infobox-margin-wrapper"><div class="uagb-ifb-content"><div class="uagb-ifb-title-wrap"><div class="uagb-ifb-separator"></div><h2 class="uagb-ifb-title"><strong>Why work with us?</strong></h2></div><p class="uagb-ifb-desc"><strong>Quality Craftsmanship:</strong><br>Our team of experienced designers, pattern makers, and production specialists are dedicated to delivering garments that reflect the latest trends and the unique style of your brand. We use premium fabrics and cutting-edge manufacturing techniques to ensure every piece is crafted with precision and care.<br><strong>Custom Solutions:</strong><br>At [Your Company Name], we understand that every brand has its own identity. That’s why we offer complete customization—from fabric selection to design details, color schemes, and size specifications—ensuring your collection stands out in a competitive market.<br><strong>Reliability and Timeliness:</strong><br>We know that time is of the essence in the fashion industry. Our efficient production processes and global logistics network guarantee that your orders are delivered on time, every time. With our flexible order options and dedicated customer service, you can focus on growing your brand while we take care of the rest.<br><strong>Sustainability Commitment:</strong><br>Modern consumers value sustainability. We are committed to using eco-friendly fabrics and ethical manufacturing practices to create products that not only look good but also help protect our planet. Our sustainable practices ensure that your brand can promote responsibility alongside style.</p><div class="uagb-ifb-button-wrapper wp-block-button"><a href="https://gmtph.com/contact/" class="uagb-infobox-cta-link wp-block-button__link" target="_self" rel="noopener noreferrer" onclick="return true;"><span class="uagb-inline-editing">Contact now</span></a></div></div></div></div>
</div></div>

	
	
</div><!-- .entry-content .clear -->

	
	
</article><!-- #post-## -->

			</main><!-- #main -->
			
		
	</div><!-- #primary -->


	</div> <!-- ast-container -->
	</div><!-- #content -->
